      "turns": [
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Good morning, Elaine. Marcus Lim here. Thanks for setting aside time for our call. Are you somewhere you can speak privately, or would another time be more convenient?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Morning, Marcus. I'm in my office with the door closed, so now is fine. Telephone is still easiest for me. Between the business and things at home, I don't always get to my emails promptly."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Certainly, we'll keep it concise. Before we get into the discussion, please provide your identification details for telephone verification."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_013]] [[EV_014]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Thank you. How has your gardening been going? Last time you mentioned spending some of your weekend outside."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Quite nicely, actually. I've been repotting my herbs and clearing the dry leaves. It's a pleasant break from the family business, although the rain keeps changing my plans."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Sounds like a good way to spend a quiet morning. Let me turn to the discussion you requested. [[EV_001]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Yes, let's go through it while I've got a quiet moment. [[EV_015]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_002]] [[EV_003]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_004]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_005]] [[EV_006]] [[EV_007]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_008]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_012]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "I'd rather keep my own wording on record, Marcus. Please don't change the way I've answered."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "I'll retain your answer as you gave it. [[EV_009]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "All right. Let me give you the practical details. [[EV_016]] [[EV_017]] [[EV_018]] [[EV_019]] [[EV_020]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_010]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_011]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Thank you, Elaine. For any follow-up administration, would you prefer a telephone call rather than an email exchange?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "A call, please. If I don't pick up, just leave your name and I'll ring you back when I'm out of a meeting."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Certainly. I'll keep any voicemail brief. Thank you for your time today, and enjoy getting back to your garden when the weather allows."
